  {
   "title": "TWITTER Strategy",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Twitter was IHC’s conversation vessel where we drove key discussions &amp; celebrated big festival moments. Whether it was highlighting Sundance themed snacks or emphasizing fan-favorite films, IHC adopted an always-on approach for fan engagement.<strong>‍</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Launch</strong>: We introduced Benji and Ash’s personas to the Sundance audience: who they were, their Sundance experiences, and their unique characteristics. </p>\n<p>‍<strong>Live</strong>: As Benji and Ash spoke to the audience, they focused on engaging with fans, re-tweeting talent, and using GIFs/images to share their reactions to films. IHC checked-in daily with key Sundance staff to review social metrics and adjust accordingly.</p>"
    },
